<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Australia meat exports down in August 96-ABS.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Australia meat exports down in August 96-ABS.</headline>
<dateline>CANBERRA 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australian exports of fresh meat (tonnes) for August 1996 from the Australian Bureau of Statistics.</p>
<p>		   Beef	Veal	   Mutton	Lamb</p>
<p>		   Bone-in  Bone-in	 Bone-in     Bone-in</p>
<p> August 96     3,548     105	     4,692	2,690</p>
<p> July   96     1,697     166	     5,084	3,440</p>
<p> August 95     3,906     144	     4,286	2,761</p>
<p>		  Beef	 Veal	   Mutton	Lamb</p>
<p>		  Bone-out   Bone-out     Bone-out    Bone-out</p>
<p> August 96    49,747	344	   3,010	 558</p>
<p> July   96    60,415	272	   4,431	 538</p>
<p> August 95    54,879	677	   4,249	 445</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-3-373-1800</p>
</text>
